  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#47865\", \"PowerToys#47355\", \"PowerToys#48389\"], \"answer\": \"Other customers have already asked for this. The request is for the PowerDisplay tray icon to be a monochrome icon that follows the Windows theme, like Twinkle Tray's brightness icon. Right now it shows as a plain grey rectangle. #47865 asks for a Twinkle Tray-style brightness icon for PowerDisplay. A PowerToys maintainer replied there that the icon may need to be improved. #47355 asks for monochrome tray icons for every PowerToys app, and one comment there asks for a brightness icon like Twinkle Tray's. #48389 asks for a 'monochrome icon that matches the Windows theme' option for PowerDisplay, Awake and the other tray apps. The main PowerToys icon already has a theme-following monochrome version. None of these tickets shows a fix or a release date for PowerDisplay. There is nothing to change in your settings for now. Add a thumbs-up or your Twinkle Tray example to those issues and follow them for updates.\"}",
